    {# The configurator modal is emitted on the `configurator` page flag alone,
       which today only src/saunas.njk sets -- the only page carrying anything
       that opens it (five data-action="open-modal" sites, pages/saunas.njk).
       Before this guard the include was sitewide: 16 built pages carried
       `id="saunaModal"` and 15 of them could not open it, each shipping a
       second, inert <form> whose empty `configuration`, `model` and
       `estimated_total` hidden inputs sat in the DOM beside the real contact
       form. A behavioural reviewer read the /contact/ one as a live field that
       had lost its data.

       The fix was written and measured once before, in WP-0b-i's fix round, and
       REVERTED there rather than shipped: the deletion is a ~350-token subtree
       and dom-integrity's delete-subtree op capped its slice search at 64, so
       certifying it required raising the cap -- and raising a limit to make the
       batch that needs it go green is the tuning-until-green move that
       instrument exists to refuse. It ships here instead, as its own batch that
       carries the harness change with it as a separately reviewed subject.

       The lightbox include stays UNGUARDED: it is opened from image grids on
       several routes, not from the configurator. #}
    {% if configurator %}{% include "modals/sauna.njk" %}{% endif %}
    {% include "modals/lightbox.njk" %}
